avif?t=1749907546\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against towering Karakuri machines! Use perfect guards to evade missiles and enemy attacks while slicing through their weak points. Destroy specific parts to limit their offensive capabilities, then kick the severed parts back at them for additional damage. And of course, in the end, you can completely dismantle these massive Karakuri with your blade!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619300/extras/dc33a0c66efccf78e540f69aff94e3d2.avif?t=1749907546\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game presents a unique <strong>Japanese-inspired sci-fi world</strong>. While drawing inspiration from Japan\u2019s Edo period, it introduces a world where a portal to another dimension\u2014opened by mysterious mechanical arts\u2014unleashes the threat of <strong>Karakuri</strong>, fearsome mechanical invaders.</p>","developers":["Osamu Yoshida"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619300/e3c8b11d989b7e2f95198110c99c2ab075ae930b/header.jpg?t=1749907546","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3619300/866093/43c9c66cd2377dc3f3280d5999bc2e31edd1dd0d/1750454367/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744139485","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3619300/866093/43c9c66c